      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "The potatoes properly burnt black, the schnitzel as tough and bland as possible, and you can leave out the salad altogether.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "And don't be shy with the bill.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.4,
      "enter": [],
